  "conflicts": [
    "dving.net swaps Shoulders/Legs (says Corrupted=Shoulders, Unraveled=Legs). The wiki tables (Kirana, Slumbering Coil Curio) and chaosboost.com agree Unraveled=Shoulders, Corrupted=Legs; we follow those.",
    "boostmatch.gg calls every leather token 'Voidcured Unraveled Nullcore' and lists old token names (Dreadful/Mystic/Venerated/Zenith); ignored.",
    "Wowhead lists item level 48 on the base token items; difficulty versions (237/250/263/276 etc.) are probably the same item ID with bonus IDs, not confirmed."
  ],
  "stillMissing": [
    "17 of 20 token item IDs and the Chiming Void Curio item ID.",
    "All reward item IDs (one per class per token: 3 or 4 each, 65 total). Reward names known only for leather hands and legs.",
    "Season 2 (Tier 36, Slumbering Coil Curio from Ula'tek, Venomous Abyss) has started and has its own tokens; not collected yet."
  ],
  "howToFinish": [
    "Open each Wowhead token page (needs the owner's approval for wowhead.com) and copy the item ID and the 'Contains'/'Creates' reward IDs.",
    "Or in game: the addon's /ll debug tokenexport records direct token observations; stage with tools/import_token_research.py.",
